A||||4||Cheever2||Fiero club websites (long)||||1||
Z||000000||Cheever2||11-27-2000||12:35 AM||||You may remember two weeks ago I was working on a list of all Fiero events for 2001.  In addition to asking PFF members for additions & corrections, I wanted to check the events calendars of the Fiero clubs' websites.  I had to create a checklist so I could know which ones I had looked at.  This became a much bigger assignment than I first thought, since I kept finding more clubs in the links of others, and since some of those links led me chasing rabbits in directions I wasn't interested in going.  Well, I've gone as far with it as I can.  For anyone interested, I will list the clubs and their websites (tell your club to update their links).  I need help with the Fiero Breakfast Club (of Ocala) - I get the "Error 403: Forbidden" unauthorized message when I try <A HREF="http://www.praxis.net/~dfarnham/" TARGET=_blank>www.praxis.net/~dfarnham/</A> <BR> <BR>Now, I KNOW there are maybe a dozen clubs without websites.  This is not a list of ALL clubs.  Remember, I just wanted to look at their events listings.<P>Several so-called clubs have websites which don't seem to support any club at all, and are simply personal pages.  I omitted those, like Silver State Fieros and Delaware Valley Fieros.  I gave FOCONE the benefit of the doubt: their site has no members list, no events list, no club links and no meeting information, but they are on everybody's links, so there must be something to it.  I left some on the list if it appears they're making a serious attempt of being a real club.  Many of the sites are so out of date that I wondered if they still have a club.<P><B>I'm asking for additions or corrections to the list below.</B>  Just as I did for my 2001 events list, I will send it to anybody who requests it.<P>Here goes with a copy & paste; hope it's readable:<P>Alabama Fieros <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/al2/alabamafieros/Page2.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.angelfire.com/al2/alabamafieros/Page2.html</A> <BR>Alamo Area 